        <p>Three falsification gates, executed: preferred-frame cutoffs FAIL CPSUV (Δc² → g²/12π²,
          unsuppressed — certified); the diamond's tip vector provably reaches the effective action and
          boost-averaging is provably not a regulator (W/12); the surviving <em>entropy</em> reading of the
          capacity is frame-free with Δc² = 0. <em>The dynamical-realization gap is the sole remaining
          Lorentz door. Not QG.</em></p>
        <span class="arrow">The gates →</span></a>
      <a class="card" href="/formalization"><h3>The operator emergence map</h3>
        <p>"Graviton = quantized area fluctuation of the screen code," theorem-shaped: the decoder inverts
          the quantized area map, the classical bridge is the coherent shadow, the flow is derived and obeys
