        <span class="arrow">The map →</span></a>
      <a class="card" href="/formalization"><h3>Spectral covariance & the grounding sweep</h3>
        <p>The spectral theorem and bounded Borel functional calculus proven unitarily covariant
          (f(UTU⁻¹) = U·f(T)·U⁻¹) — and used to delete carried hinges across three landed campaigns:
