          K&nbsp;=&nbsp;−log&nbsp;Δ as a genuine unbounded operator, and Δ<sup>it</sup>&nbsp;=&nbsp;e<sup>−itK</sup>
          as a C₀ unitary group with <em>derived</em> Stone generator — in any proof assistant.</li>
        <li><strong>An unbounded Stone theorem + spectral machinery beyond Mathlib</strong> — the
