      <p style="margin-top:.5rem"><strong>What this is — and is not.</strong> The graviton development is standard
      <em>free-field</em> QFT (linearized, flat background, no interactions), machine-checked — not quantum
      gravity. The bridge is a <em>conditional linearized assembly</em>: every derived step is a theorem, and
